rect numbers but in Visual Profiler both the GPU timings column and the GPU chart show zero usage when they should show super high times for 20fps / ~55ms frame render times. \n\nMonitor:\n\n<img width=\"1365\" height=\"495\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a31831d-0b19-41a7-95bf-3a3a17e63e16\" />\n\nProfiler:\n\n<img width=\"1367\" height=\"492\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf9901f2-0638-47dc-8771-97e2fe689dcc\" />\n\nVisual Profiler:\n\n<img width=\"1361\" height=\"492\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/945f5875-85c0-41d6-8b42-b0b227a52119\" />\n\n  \n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen and run any Godot project with latest v4.5.1.stable on Apple Silicon Mac (or just use the attached test project, doesn't really matter). Check GPU timings in Debugger Visual Profiler.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[visual-profiler-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23010126/visual-profiler-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"iamvoidcoder","id":81540569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTQwNTY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81540569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder","html_url":"https://github.com/iamvoidcoder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public",